Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:12.82,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1226.666,746)}第1话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:12.82,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fade(800,900)\pos(1510.666,823.999)}樱花季的邂逅与暴风雪的预感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:18.42,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}冷たい指先感じられる距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:18.42,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}能感受到指尖冰凉的距离感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:24.50,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}もどかしくて少し切ない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:24.50,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}令人急不可待  又有些许愁绪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:30.51,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}ひとつずつ灯る街灯に呼応して
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:30.51,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}与一盏盏点亮的路灯遥相呼应
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:36.36,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}募っていく気持ちに気付いた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:36.36,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}觉察到心中一点点积攒的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:44.01,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,照れ隠してもクールぶっても {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:44.01,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,不管是遮羞  抑或是装酷 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:46.90,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,見透かされそう {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:46.90,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,都像会被看透似的 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:50.06,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,やさしく {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:50.06,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,温柔地 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:52.31,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Freeze for a minute {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:52.31,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,冻结一分钟 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:55.32,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,心ごと {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:55.32,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,全心全意 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:01:01.44,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,I miss you 言わせたくて {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:01:01.44,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,想让你说  我想你 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.67,0:01:04.60,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Let me love you honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.67,0:01:04.60,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,让我爱你  honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:07.63,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,言えない for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:07.63,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,说不出口  for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:15.62,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,いつか言葉にできたら {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:15.62,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,假如有朝一日能说出口 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:57.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛  你要好好看家哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.41,0:01:59.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我会给你带手信的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:04.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那  我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.53,0:02:10.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天是就职仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.85,0:02:13.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也终于步入社会了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.51,0:02:18.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,虽说如此  感觉与以往也没什么不同
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:23.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,从学生时代开始…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:26.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月同学好酷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.53,0:02:28.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嗯  好沉着冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.44,0:02:29.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:33.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就总被这样说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:42.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我可能比别人更缺乏感性吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.48,0:03:00.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:13.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:17.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个  您的腿怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.67,0:03:20.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,噢…抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:25.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天是就职仪式  太紧张了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.30,0:03:31.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因为腿冻成冰块离不开这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.13,0:03:35.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我在试图看樱花让自己冷静下来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.05,0:03:40.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:46.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也有试过几次  紧张到走不动路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:50.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但我还是第一次见到物理性质上的冻住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:55.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:58.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我带了热茶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:01.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,倒点下去怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:02.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:03.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:09.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,完全没用
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.61,0:04:12.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他到底有多紧张啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:23.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您要…喝茶吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:29.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,请
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:31.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这可真是  给您添麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.24,0:04:32.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:38.46,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,海带
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:36.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,请用
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:38.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:53.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  裂开了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.45,0:04:55.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.99,0:05:02.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,春天挺不错的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我其实是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:09.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪女的后裔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:12.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪…女？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:15.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的  雪女
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.16,0:05:19.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一旦情绪有波动  就会结出冰来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.08,0:05:24.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,妖怪…的后裔？  我还是第一次见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:30.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因为是雪女的后裔  经常被人以为喜欢冬天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.64,0:05:32.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.26,0:05:38.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,花开烂漫  能有新邂逅的春天…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:42.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我其实也喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.03,0:05:52.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,谢谢您的茶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:53.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:57.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,托您的福  我没那么紧张了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:01.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.05,0:06:02.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,再会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.98,0:06:12.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:14.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐真酷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:16.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,从不会表现出惊讶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:19.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,也没什么喜欢的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:24.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,学生时代的我  的确是那样子的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.82,0:06:28.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真惊讶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:33.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一上来遇到了过去没遇过的类型
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:38.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,还能再见到他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.11,0:06:43.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因为太过紧张冻成冰块的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.65,0:06:45.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我已经试过好几次了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:48.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.37,0:06:52.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,遇到那样的人还是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:54.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,既亲切又温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:30.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原来我们  是同一家公司的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:32.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您也是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:35.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原来真有这么巧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.79,0:07:38.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嗯  之后就是同事了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.29,0:07:41.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.64,0:07:51.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能在这里再见面真是奇迹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.12,0:07:57.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,什么  这是什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:04.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,毛茸茸…的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:10.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的  我其实是妖狐的后裔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:11.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.40,0:08:14.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是雪女的后裔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.99,0:08:16.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪女的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:18.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.28,0:08:20.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:22.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是冴岛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:25.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我叫冰室
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:27.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是冬月
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.08,0:08:29.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我叫狐森
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:34.69,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,您也是什么的后裔？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:34.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,您也是什么的后裔？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.01,0:08:37.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是人类的后裔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:38.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.56,0:08:41.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,从今往后  请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:42.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:44.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:44.81,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:48.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,话说回来  从刚才我就很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:50.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那位部长…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:54.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是大佛的后裔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.83,0:08:58.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不不  大佛只是一尊佛像罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:01.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原来只是长得像吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.51,0:09:05.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛  我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:15.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是加了扇贝和鲷鱼的鲣鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:22.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喵梅洛  我今天认识了好多人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.11,0:09:27.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我有预感  会发生未曾体验过的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.35,0:09:28.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:31.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是给你看家的奖励
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.98,0:09:36.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你喜欢就好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.44,0:09:45.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,小猫咪行为
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:00.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真期待明天的到来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:21.77,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那个  冰室先生  有点冷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:25.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  一不小心就入神了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:31.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你喜欢花吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.26,0:10:33.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,超喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:37.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是…我碰到的东西都会冻住
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:46.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是会下霜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.89,0:10:47.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.77,0:10:50.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我可以说是喜爱花
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:53.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,却不被花所爱的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:02.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,肯定有什么其他方法…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.17,0:11:04.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对吧  喵梅洛？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:10.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:17.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不介意的话  请试试这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:19.11,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,园艺用纯国产
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:19.11,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,铺地稻草
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:20.77,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,稻草？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:24.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:25.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,铺地的稻草
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:30.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能避免植物因下霜而枯萎的优良产品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:35.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,花和冰室先生都无精打采的就太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:38.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,所以我就查了查有没有办法解决
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.33,0:11:40.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等等…冬月小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:41.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.55,0:11:44.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你是扛着这袋稻草来上班的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:46.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.73,0:11:48.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我有考虑到给周围人添麻烦的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:53.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,所以是搭始发电车来的  别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.16,0:11:59.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  你真是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:02.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他笑了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:05.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能帮上你的忙就好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:06.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.76,0:12:14.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:16.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐好温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:19.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,老喜欢她了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.37,0:12:22.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,被她这样对待  我会融化掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:25.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰  冰室先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:27.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:37.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:39.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你一脸认真地在看什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:41.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,还有  我稍微有点冷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:44.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  抱歉冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.35,0:12:46.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我不知不觉就看入迷了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:49.20,Koori-picture1,,0,0,0,,{\frz9.368\pos(758,134)}热门帖子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:48.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,猫？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.31,0:12:52.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我虽然喜欢猫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.44,0:12:56.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但心情一激动身边就会结冰  没法摸它们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:08.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,所以  只能看猫片来治愈身心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:12.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,说起来  我家也养了只猫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:16.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:24.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真好啊  我也想摸摸真的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:36.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.98,0:13:42.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这个  不介意的话请收下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.91,0:13:45.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是猫的胡须
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:46.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,胡须？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:51.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我家猫的胡须有时候会掉到地板上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:58.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我把它们一根根收集起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:03.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要是摸不了真正的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:06.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我想  至少可以摸摸真的胡须
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.59,0:14:08.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:13.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而且  猫的胡须好像可以作护身符呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:18.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,希望…冰室先生能好事常伴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.59,0:14:26.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,总觉得  给男人送护身符  有点害羞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:29.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.91,0:14:38.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太可爱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:42.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  竟然为了我的幸福祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:46.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,胡须护身符也太灵了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.56,0:14:49.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,猫  猫的胡须最棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:54.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他那么迷恋猫的胡须吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:56.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真是个吓人的爱猫人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:14:59.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.74,0:15:01.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你真是太温柔了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:06.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也想为冬月小姐做点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.11,0:15:14.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:15.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,请吃甜点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.76,0:15:27.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这不是那个  限时抢购很有人气的…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:31.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是巧克力橙子开心果冰激凌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.11,0:15:35.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是冬月小姐你  之前说过想尝尝的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.76,0:15:42.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:45.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不是到处都卖光了  买不到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:48.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊不是  我只是碰巧买到了而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:54.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,到  到处找了一周的事绝对要向她保密
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:59.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他其实是四处寻找才买到给我的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.35,0:16:03.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:07.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这也太可爱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.95,0:16:10.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,想说谢谢的反倒是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:12.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.21,0:16:15.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,小雪人  很可爱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:19.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,完蛋  我太开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.61,0:16:21.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,明明只是一点小小的回礼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.77,0:16:24.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她却百万倍地还给了我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:26.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等下  冰室先生  好冷啊好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.27,0:16:32.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天天气很好  感觉很舒适呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.02,0:16:35.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,话说  冬月小姐你…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:39.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,对冰室先生很亲切啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:41.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:43.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我对他很普通啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:48.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐真是个大好人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:52.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:53.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但是好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:58.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐确实是个好人…痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:02.64,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她真是个  超级大好人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:13.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪洞？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.57,0:17:17.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他心情一消沉  好像就会躲进雪洞里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:20.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天好像是犯了什么错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:26.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好像是因为他花一天时间做的资料数据丢失了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:27.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,部长
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:30.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我跟他说明天再弄也行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:31.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但他本人坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:35.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  我今天能做完
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:38.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就这样  没听我的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:40.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真像是冰室先生会做的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:49.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天要加班了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:50.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:54.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,其实我犯了个大错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.04,0:17:57.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有什么我能帮你的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:07.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:09.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这是我自己的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:11.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:14.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那你辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.75,0:18:15.82,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你也辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.26,0:18:30.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不要太勉强自己了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.06,0:18:32.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.00,0:18:33.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:39.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她好帅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.36,0:18:42.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,被冬月小姐关心了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.19,0:18:47.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她不仅仅是可爱  还兼具帅气感
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:56.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冴岛先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:58.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你的脸怎么这么红？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.63,0:19:03.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我有点感冒  好像发烧了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:04.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:07.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,别太勉强自己  今天早点回去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.07,0:19:09.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也想早点回去…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:15.21,Koori-picture2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1154,646)\frz10.25}公司内项目表
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:14.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可今天的工作毫无进展
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:18.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那我给你做个好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:19.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.62,0:19:23.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,手作退烧贴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:26.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不这个  绝对贴不上去的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.28,0:19:28.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不需要啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:30.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,诶  你试试看嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:31.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,穿着西装？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.31,0:19:33.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,把毛巾缠到脑袋上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:35.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:36.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,像喝多了似的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:38.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你真是任性啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.07,0:19:41.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我是任性  不用你操心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.97,0:19:43.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那把这份文件给我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:47.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,健康管理也是很重要的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我会帮你做完的  你赶紧回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:52.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:20:00.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,基本都被他拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.69,0:20:05.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  你人真温柔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:06.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,没有的事  冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:09.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这点文件算不了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.35,0:20:11.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而且我们是同事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:12.98,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:24.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,被她夸温柔了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:30.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他制造出来的东西很冷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.75,0:20:32.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,却是个热心肠的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:33.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.09,0:20:35.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:38.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我回来了  喵梅洛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.43,0:20:43.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,有乖乖看家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:51.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,终于睡在里面了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:07.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,但你还会回来的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.09,0:21:13.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,从那天起  到今天刚好一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.14,0:21:19.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,进入公司到今天已经一个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.66,0:21:30.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  真是个好人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:33.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我真是进了个好公司
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:35.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,当社会人最棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.16,0:21:38.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:44.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,下周的新员工研修旅行的目的地已经定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.89,0:21:46.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,去冲绳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:47.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冲绳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.72,0:21:48.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:49.93,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.49,0:21:54.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冲  冲绳？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.06,0:22:01.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不行  我要是去了冲绳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.44,0:22:04.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,会发生不得了的事的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.45,0:22:25.15,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,ふと気づけばまた視線は　追い掛けてしまう君の姿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.15,0:22:32.49,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,ふと気づけばまた視線は　追い掛けてしまう君の姿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.45,0:22:25.15,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,突然发觉之时  视线又追逐上你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.15,0:22:32.49,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,突然发觉之时  视线又追逐上你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.21,0:22:39.83,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,嫌なことがあっても心は　雨上がりの空のように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.83,0:22:47.17,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,嫌なことがあっても心は　雨上がりの空のように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.21,0:22:39.83,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,即使遇上坏事  心也如雨后初晴的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.83,0:22:47.17,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,即使遇上坏事  心也如雨后初晴的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.52,0:22:54.47,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,君の笑顔はどうしてこんなにも　ポカポカで温かいの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.47,0:23:00.56,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,君の笑顔はどうしてこんなにも　ポカポカで温かいの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.52,0:22:54.47,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,你的笑容为何  如此和煦温暖春风拂面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.47,0:23:00.56,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,你的笑容为何  如此和煦温暖春风拂面
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.59,0:23:08.07,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　君のこと　何でもいいからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.59,0:23:08.07,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,告诉我可以吗  只要是关于你什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.28,0:23:15.16,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,好きなこと　好きなもの　私にだけそっと
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.28,0:23:15.16,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,只悄悄告诉我  你喜欢的事也好物也罢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.38,0:23:22.77,Koori-ED-JP-blue,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　いつの日か　二人のこの距離を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.38,0:23:22.77,Koori-ED-CN-blue,,0,0,0,,告诉我可以吗  总会有一天我们的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.15,0:23:33.48,Koori-ED-JP-yellow,,0,0,0,,少しずつ　少しずつ　なんて少しだけ期待してる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.15,0:23:33.48,Koori-ED-CN-yellow,,0,0,0,,我无比期待着  它能一点一点日渐缩短
